      "positive_trace": [
        {
          "event": "model_gate",
          "verdict": "PASS"
        },
        {
          "event": "objective_gate",
          "verdict": "PASS"
        },
        {
          "event": "task",
          "verdict": "DONE"
        }
      ],
      "assertion": "Model agreement may pass only its narrow gate. Real objective failure prevents overall completion; select a safe separating probe or report the evidence blocker. Both independently checked gates permit completion; no compulsory simulator is introduced."
